%% A pipeline whose steps can each stop early: four exits run into one node.
%% merman's text layout cannot route them all, so fm draws this as a rail.
flowchart TD
  start[Pick the work] --> read[Read it]
  read -->|nothing to do| report[Write the report]
  read --> build[Build]
  build --> check[Check]
  check -->|first failure| build
  check -->|second failure| report
  check --> review[Review]
  review -->|no review| report
  review --> merge[Merge]
  merge -->|blocked| report
  merge -->|release| release[Release]
  merge --> close[Close]
  release --> close
  close --> report
